    {
        dataType="Comment";
		class PositionInfo {position[]={0,0,-8};};
        title="Transport Services (guided example): both vehicles already contain correctly sided WEST AI drivers. Their init fields only register the existing transports; they never create crew. Use ACE Self Interact > WMP Transport to request a named or nearest service. Raven One searches up to 500 m and uses the shipped 1.5x landing-clearance multiplier. Keep simulation enabled and leave clear space around both bases. See the minimal composition for the smallest working calls. Wiki: https://github.com/AdamWaldie/WaldosMissionPack/wiki/Transport-Services";
